      "id": "DC_kwDOKrJqmc4A70rL",
      "body": "if you installed orbic using `./installer orbic` (not `orbic-usb`) that FAQ entry is not relevant. USB tethering should already work out of the box, but if it doesn't then that's an issue with the stock device that we can't do much about.\r\n\r\nI fixed the docs in https://github.com/EFForg/rayhunter/pull/844",
